<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-backend-engineering-team-lead-london-manchester-271704> a prov:Entity,
        schema:JobPosting ;
    dcterms:source <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/source/arbeitnow> ;
    prov:generatedAtTime "2026-09-12T07:40:16+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/occurrence/arbeitnow-backend-engineering-team-lead-london-manchester-271704/1>,
        <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/netcraft/backend-engineering-team-lead-london-manchester-271704> ;
    kgjobs:active true ;
    kgjobs:canonicalFingerprint "5b97859df3b838d1ac3326180186a862bf4eaeb09295acf657ba7d3677869cec" ;
    kgjobs:classification "not_match" ;
    kgjobs:firstSeenAt "2026-09-12T07:40:16+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:lastSeenAt "2026-09-12T07:40:16+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    kgjobs:reconciliationReason "no reviewed first-party candidate" ;
    kgjobs:sourceOccurrence <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/occurrence/arbeitnow-backend-engineering-team-lead-london-manchester-271704/1> ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "backend-engineering-team-lead-london-manchester-271704" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-09-11"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>About Netcraft</strong></p> <p>Netcraft is the global leader in cybercrime detection and disruption. We’re a trusted partner for three of the four largest companies in the world and many large governments. We've blocked over 225 million cyber-attacks to date, and we take down around 33% of the world's phishing attacks.</p> <p>Our purpose and passion are focused on just one thing: protecting the world from cybercrime.</p> <p>That passion shapes how we work, too. We’re proud of our talented team and the value each person brings, and we’ve built a workplace where people feel supported and inspired. From strong benefits and wellness programs to meaningful collaboration and team connection.&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p></div><p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"156\"><strong data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"156\">The Role</strong></p> <p data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"306\">We’re looking for a Backend Engineering Team Lead to establish and lead a new backend team responsible for several key Netcraft products, including:</p> <ul data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"637\"> <li data-section-id=\"1dvamb\" data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"413\">The <strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"335\">Integration Layer</strong>, which enables customers to integrate their SIEM platforms with Netcraft data</li> <li data-section-id=\"q97nlw\" data-start=\"414\" data-end=\"506\"><strong data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"423\">NSI</strong>, which supports engagement with criminals conducting conversational scams at scale</li> <li data-section-id=\"ebjopp\" data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"542\">The <strong data-start=\"513\" data-end=\"542\">Web and SSL Server Survey</strong></li> <li data-section-id=\"e6uc9c\" data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"637\"><strong data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"553\">Spam</strong>, which analyses emails from multiple sources to identify phishing and scam activity</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"966\">These products are a mixture of legacy platforms that produce key data supporting Netcraft systems and new products that support our customer base. You’ll be a technical leader with expertise across a varied stack, with the commercial acumen to understand how to modernise legacy products as well as commercialise new products.</p> <p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1122\">You will build a new team to manage and improve these products, contributing code, demonstrating best practice, and managing an exciting delivery roadmap.</p> <p data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1138\"><strong data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1138\">You’ll be:</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"2275\"> <li data-section-id=\"1fdvs3k\" data-start=\"1140\" data-end=\"1327\">Working with Product and Design colleagues to evaluate each of your products, determining where immediate improvements can be made and helping to develop the long-term strategy for each</li> <li data-section-id=\"1buvgr3\" data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1469\">Operating with autonomy, taking the initiative to solve problems and recognising the importance of adhering to demanding delivery timelines</li> <li data-section-id=\"damfod\" data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1629\">Managing requirements from key stakeholders and customers, understanding what needs to be done based on business needs without necessarily needing to be told</li> <li data-section-id=\"xra4nz\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1769\">Prioritising, refining, and sequencing the team’s workflow while retaining approximately <strong data-start=\"1721\" data-end=\"1769\">30–50% of your time for hands-on engineering</strong></li> <li data-section-id=\"17j3hhy\" data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1904\">Deeply embedded in conceiving and executing engineering solutions, creating performant systems and services to delight our customers</li> <li data-section-id=\"1tqbfop\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2087\">Upholding high engineering standards with a demonstrable commitment to code quality, a test-driven approach, and a modern continuous integration/continuous deployment delivery flow</li> <li data-section-id=\"1wrq2gn\" data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2174\">Well-versed in how AI-first development techniques can materially boost productivity</li> <li data-section-id=\"18lmgyb\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2275\">Responsible for building and leading a high-performing team of talented and enthusiastic engineers</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2314\"><strong data-start=\"2277\" data-end=\"2314\">What You’ll Need to Be Successful</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"3455\"> <li data-section-id=\"hx5bed\" data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2465\">Strong and demonstrable leadership skills, with a constructive attitude to problem-solving and the ability to switch effectively between priorities</li> <li data-section-id=\"e4icvp\" data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2598\">Excellent communication skills, including the ability to distil technical concepts for a range of stakeholders and motivate a team</li> <li data-section-id=\"197yupv\" data-start=\"2599\" data-end=\"2754\">A strong engineering background spanning a range of technologies, including <strong data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2708\">Go, OpenSearch, and MongoDB</strong>, with Perl experience considered an advantage</li> <li data-section-id=\"19b0f1i\" data-start=\"2755\" data-end=\"2918\">A demonstrable track record of identifying opportunities to create significant value within existing products and taking ideas from concept through to production</li> <li data-section-id=\"t530hs\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"3114\">Experience partnering closely with Product Managers and Product Owners to shape product strategy, define priorities, and translate customer and business needs into effective technical solutions</li> <li data-section-id=\"u3msr6\" data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3214\">Experience working with <strong data-start=\"3141\" data-end=\"3161\">AWS technologies</strong> and a range of machine learning tools and frameworks</li> <li data-section-id=\"qwnayl\" data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3331\">An interest in reverse-engineering codebases, where necessary, to understand the inner workings of legacy products</li> <li data-section-id=\"na70vf\" data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3455\">Experience interviewing and hiring engineers, building effective teams, and fostering a culture of continuous improvement</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3486\"><strong data-start=\"3457\" data-end=\"3486\">Bonus Points If You Have:</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3806\"> <li data-section-id=\"1m7cjng\" data-start=\"3488\" data-end=\"3579\">Strong Go development skills, particularly in technology modernisation or uplift projects</li> <li data-section-id=\"iumu7a\" data-start=\"3580\" data-end=\"3688\">Experience with generative AI technologies and where and how to apply them to improve customer experiences</li> <li data-section-id=\"q12ahq\" data-start=\"3689\" data-end=\"3806\">Practical experience managing engineers at different career stages, from recent graduates to seasoned professionals</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3831\"><strong data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3831\">The Rewards Package</strong></p> <ul> <li>33 days annual leave - includes public holidays which can be worked if you prefer&nbsp;</li> <li>Generous enhanced family leave and pay&nbsp;</li> <li>Enhanced company sick pay from day one of employment, with additional support after your first six months’ service</li> <li>Salary sacrifice pension with matched employer contributions up to 5% + NI savings&nbsp;</li> <li>Private health cover, including access to a private GP service&nbsp;</li> <li>Life Assurance at 4 x salary&nbsp;</li> <li>Equity tracking scheme (eligibility criteria apply) - allowing you share in Netcraft's long term success&nbsp;</li> <li>Hybrid and flexible working options&nbsp;</li> <li>Meals, snacks, and drinks provided in the office&nbsp;</li> <li>Comprehensive health, safety, and wellness service available 24/7 for you and your family&nbsp;</li> <li>Two paid Learning &amp; Development days per year plus access to learning resources such as Udemy and Coursera to support your career&nbsp;</li> <li>Two Volunteering Days per year, to allow you to contribute to your wider community or charity&nbsp;</li> <li>Employee Referral Bonus scheme&nbsp;</li> <li>Spot reward bonus scheme to reward truly outstanding contributions&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p data-start=\"3808\" data-end=\"3831\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p></p> <p><strong>Diversity, Equity &amp; Inclusion&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>This is deeply important to us. Through our ally network, we support under-represented groups and&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;a working environment free from bias, harassment, or discrimination. We encourage candidates from all backgrounds to apply.&nbsp;</p> <p>We’re also happy to make adjustments to the hiring process to ensure every candidate can participate fully.&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Please note:</strong> Netcraft does not accept unsolicited approaches from external recruiters.&nbsp;</p> <p></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-netcraft ;
