    schema:description "Our publishing house regularly releases new paperbacks and eBooks. We offer cookbooks, non-fiction, guides, children's books, and much more. To gather honest customer opinions, we are looking for reader-testers who will evaluate the entire process - from purchasing to receiving the book or eBook, as well as the book's content - and provide us with feedback. Tasks For this, we are looking for book enthusiasts in english who would like to receive our latest books and eBooks for free. Of course, the books may be kept. Requirements - Passionate readers - Perfect command of the English language - An UK Amazon account (amazon.co.uk) - Reliability We look forward to receiving your application! :) Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
