    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "senior-design-engineer-design-system-munich-104279" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-09-12"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI's operational blind spots into operational clarity. World's leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there's a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.</p></div><p><strong>Why this role matters</strong></p> <p>At Celonis, design has to scale across a complex, enterprise-grade process intelligence platform, and increasingly, it has to scale to machines as well as people. AI coding agents now generate a growing share of the UI our engineers ship, and our design system is the contract that keeps that output on-brand, accessible, and consistent.</p> <p>This role sits at the intersection of design, engineering, and product, with a strong emphasis on craft, usability, and scalability. You'll design and build the system itself, owning interaction decisions and front-end architecture, and translating complex process data and AI-driven behaviors into intuitive, high-performance experiences. It's a senior role: you'll often operate with minimal design oversight, set standards, lead initiatives, and mentor others while staying deeply hands-on in both design and code.</p> <p><strong>About the team</strong></p> <p>You'll join the team that owns Celonis's design system and the operations behind how design gets done. We sit at the intersection of design and engineering, and we treat the system as a living product with real users, internal designers, product engineers, and the AI agents that now consume it.</p> <p><strong>What you'll do</strong></p> <ul> <li>Design and build production components in Angular and TypeScript, our design system is built in Angular and we may adopt React over time, on a foundation of rock-solid HTML and CSS (semantic markup, ARIA, and modern CSS custom properties driving design tokens).</li> <li>Own interaction decisions, component design, and front-end architecture end-to-end, independently translating ambiguous requirements into thoughtful, usable UX.</li> <li>Translate complex process-intelligence data and AI-driven behaviors into clear, intuitive, high-performance operator experiences.</li> <li>Set the technical and craft standard for front-end quality, polish, motion and animation, performance, and accessibility, across the team.</li> <li>Drive rapid prototyping to explore novel interaction concepts and turn ambitious design visions into distinctive, testable experiences.</li> <li>Collaborate with designers, PMs, and engineers to derive and evolve the design system through a healthy contribution model.</li> <li>Make the system agent-ready: maintain tokens-as-code in the W3C DTCG format (Style Dictionary or similar) and structure component metadata, docs, and APIs so AI coding agents can consume them as reliable context.</li> <li>Author and maintain Figma Code Connect mappings so Figma components link cleanly to their coded counterparts for engineers and agents alike.</li> <li>Build evals as guardrails, visual-regression, accessibility, and token-compliance checks in CI, so generated and contributed UI meets the bar before it ships.</li> <li>Use AI tooling daily (Figma Make, v0, Cursor, Claude Code, Copilot, or similar), applying senior design and engineering judgment to critique and correct the output.</li> <li>Lead system initiatives and mentor designers and engineers contributing to it.</li> </ul> <p><strong>What you'll bring</strong></p> <ul> <li>Around 5–8 years across design engineering / UX engineering / front-end, including significant hands-on work building a design system or component library in a SaaS or B2B environment.</li> <li>Excellent UX instincts with strong attention to interaction detail and usability, you can own design decisions independently, with minimal oversight.</li> <li>Strong production front-end skills in Angular and TypeScript with rock-solid HTML and CSS fundamentals; experience with (or genuine openness to) React is a plus.</li> <li>Deep understanding of design token architecture (primitive → semantic → component tiers) and modern token pipelines.</li> <li>Strong Figma fluency and comfort moving fluidly between design and code.</li> <li>Demonstrated accessibility expertise (WCAG 2.2) implemented in code.</li> <li>Hands-on fluency with AI design and coding tools, and an opinionated, responsible point of view on using them.</li> <li>A strong product mindset and bias toward ownership, plus the communication and leadership of a senior IC.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Bonus points</strong></p> <ul> <li>Experience with Figma Code Connect in production.</li> <li>Experience building or integrating MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers e.g. the Figma Dev Mode MCP server or a custom design-system MCP server.</li> <li>Experience building evals for AI-generated UI, or writing specs/prompts for AI generation.</li> <li>Background working on complex, data-dense, or real-time interfaces (a strong fit for our process-intelligence product).</li> <li>Token-pipeline experience with Style Dictionary, Tokens Studio, or equivalent.</li> </ul> <p><strong>How we work</strong></p> <p>This is a senior role: you'll own major areas of the system with full autonomy, design and ship with a high bar for craft, set the standards others build to, lead initiatives, and mentor. We pair design craft with engineering depth and high curiosity about AI, building a system that's faster and safer for humans and agents alike.</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>What Celonis can offer you:</strong></p> <ul class=\"p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested\" data-stringify-type=\"unordered-list\" data-list-tree=\"true\" data-indent=\"0\" data-border=\"0\"> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Pioneer Innovation:</span> Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.</li> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Ownership from Day 1:</span> Every full-time \"Celonaut\" is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.</li> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Unrivaled Family Support:</span> Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.</li> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Work-Life Integration:</span> Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.</li> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Continuous Growth:</span> Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.</li> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Holistic Well-being:</span> Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated \"Wellness Weeks\" that prioritize work/life balance.</li> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Drive Sustainability:</span> Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.</li> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Global Inclusion &amp; Belonging:</span> Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.</li> <li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Value-Driven Impact:</span> Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.</li> </ul> <p><strong>About Us:</strong></p> <p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1264\">Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.</p> <p data-renderer-start-pos=\"1982\">Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this <a class=\"_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">video</a>.</p> <p><strong>Celonis Inclusion Statement:</strong></p> <p>At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that's when creativity and innovation happen.<strong><br></strong></p> <p><strong>Your Privacy:</strong></p> <p>Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ <a href=\"https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices\">Accessibility and Candidate Notices</a></p> <p>By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our <a href=\"https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/\">Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process</a>.</p> <p>Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more <a href=\"https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/\">here</a>.</p></div> Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
