    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p></p> <p><strong><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">About THG Ingenuity</span></strong></p> <p>THG Ingenuity is a fully integrated digital commerce ecosystem, designed to power brands without limits. Our global end-to-end tech platform is comprised of three products: THG Commerce, THG Studios, THG Fulfilment.&nbsp;</p> <p>Each represents a single, unified solution, overcoming challenges and taking brands direct-to-consumer. Our client portfolio includes globally recognised brands such as Coca-Cola, Nestle, Elemis, Homebase, and Proctor &amp; Gamble.</p></div><p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">Overview</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;a commercially minded Senior Financial Controller to join a unique role spanning both THG Ingenuity and a private Family Office portfolio.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This role is the finance lead for King Street Townhouse Hotel and Hale Country Club, whilst helping develop the governance, reporting and financial capability of a growing Family Office portfolio</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Reporting into senior leadership, the successful candidate will lead a small finance team and act as a trusted business partner to operational management, providing insight,&nbsp;challenge&nbsp;and financial leadership across multiple businesses.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This role offers a rare combination of hospitality, commercial&nbsp;finance&nbsp;and family office exposure, making it an ideal opportunity for an ambitious Financial Controller looking to broaden their experience beyond a traditional finance environment.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 1\">Key Responsibilities</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Hospitality Finance Leadership</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Lead all aspects of finance for King Street Townhouse Hotel and Hale Country Club &amp; Spa, including:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Monthly management accounts and performance reporting</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Budgeting,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">forecasting</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">&nbsp;and long-term planning</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Board reporting and financial commentary</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Cash flow forecasting and working capital management</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">KPI reporting and analysis</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Capex appraisals and investment analysis</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Balance sheet oversight and control environment</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Annual audit support and statutory reporting</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">VAT and tax compliance oversight</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Commercial Business Partnering</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Act as a key partner to operational leadership teams by:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Supporting commercial decision-making</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"11\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Analysing</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">&nbsp;pricing strategies and revenue opportunities</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"12\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Reviewing membership,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">occupancy</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">utilisation</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">&nbsp;trends</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"13\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Identifying</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">&nbsp;risks and opportunities within trading performance</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"14\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Supporting major projects and investment initiatives</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"15\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Providing financial challenge and insight to proposed business decisions</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Family Office Finance Leadership</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support the continued development of a growing Family Office portfolio, including:</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"16\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Oversight of reporting across international property and private asset structures</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"17\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Review of management accounts and forecasts prepared by the wider finance team</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"18\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Coordination with external advisers,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">accountants</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">&nbsp;and professional service providers</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"19\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Governance and financial control improvements</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"20\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Support for strategic projects,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">acquisitions</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">&nbsp;and new business initiatives</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;singleLevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"21\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"List Bullet\">Development of reporting frameworks and management information</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:50,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">The successful candidate will not be expected to arrive with specialist family office or international structuring&nbsp;knowledge, but&nbsp;should have the capability and curiosity to develop&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;over time.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">Team Leadership</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:100,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span><