    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><strong>About the Company</strong></span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><strong>Affinidi&nbsp;</strong>is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. </span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.</span></p> <hr> <p>&nbsp;</p></div><p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager (Technical) who wants to help define how trust is built into the next generation of AI systems. At Affinidi, we’re building the Trust Fabric product suite to give AI agents verifiable identity, policy guardrails, and real-time observability, so organisations can move from promising proofs of concept to secure, governed production deployments with confidence.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This is a role for builders. You’ll work side by side with engineering to turn ambitious ideas into real, high-impact products, fast, iteratively, and with strong product judgment. You’ll take on complex, ambiguous challenges that don’t come with a playbook, bring structure to what matters, and help the team move with clarity, speed, and conviction. You’ll also collaborate with deeply engaged teams and senior leaders in an environment that expects high standards, values ownership, and gives you the chance to shape meaningful products from the ground up.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">If you like combining technical depth, product thinking, and execution, you’ll fit right in.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What you’ll be doing</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Shape and deliver solutions</span></em><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">: </span></em></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Partner closely with engineers to define and refine solutions early, helping move ideas from concept to production in practical, incremental steps while staying close enough to implementation to understand trade-offs and guide decisions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Drive focused, outcome-oriented delivery:</span></em></strong><em> </em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Balance user needs, market context, and execution speed while focusing on getting working solutions into users’ hands for validation, then iterate based on feedback and measurable outcomes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Work through ambiguity</span></em></strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong>:</strong> </span></em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Take ownership of areas where requirements are not fully defined, structure problems into clear, actionable paths forward, and maintain momentum even as direction continues to evolve.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Own product direction:</span></em><em> </em></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Contribute to product strategy and roadmap definition, align short-term priorities with longer-term platform thinking, and make thoughtful trade-offs that support both delivery and scalability.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Collaborate across stakeholders</span></em><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">: </span></em></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Work across engineering, design, and go-to-market teams, engage effectively with senior and executive stakeholders, and bring alignment and clarity in environments with diverse perspectives.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Be developer-obsessed</span></em></strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong>:</strong> </span></em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Understand developer workflows and key pain points, and help improve integration, usability, and the overall product experience.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What we’re looking for</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Core experience</span></em><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">: </span></em></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You bring 5+ years of experience in Technical Product Management, a strong technical background that lets you engage deeply with engineering topics, hands-on experience working with APIs, systems, and integrations, and a proven track record of delivering products in close collaboration with engineering teams.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Technical depth</span></em><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">: </span></em></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">You are comfortable understanding how systems are designed and operate in practice, able to engage in technical discussions, challenge assumptions, and evaluate trade-offs, and willing to go into detail when needed by reviewing flows, investigating issues, or clarifying implementation approaches.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Mindset</span></em></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong>: </strong>You take ownership from problem to outcome, are comfortable working with ambiguity and evolving priorities, combine structured thinking with a bias toward action, and can move between big-picture strategy and practical execution.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Collaboration &amp; communication</span></em></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong>: </strong>You communicate effectively across technical and non-technical audiences, are comfortable working with experienced, highly engaged stakeholders, and know how to build alignment and drive decisions forward.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><strong><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Nice to have</span></em></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><strong>: </strong>It’s a plus if you have had exposure to identity, distributed systems, or similar domains, and experience in fast-paced, product-led environments.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">What you’ll get</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A team that values ownership, quality, and speed</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Close collaboration between product and engineering</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Hybrid working model in Berlin + flexible hours</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Unlimited vacation</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Competitive compensation</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">A strong environment to learn, build, and have impact</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><hr> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Equal Opportunity</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We believe in hiring different and diverse talent and providing a safe space where everyone can share their views without fear, where differences are celebrated, and where no one is left out. Inclusive cultures are the foundation for collaboration and innovation within our team.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong data-stringify-type=\"bold\">Privacy Notice</strong></p> <p>By applying for this position, you confirm that you have read and understood <a class=\"c-link\" href=\"https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-stringify-link=\"https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf\" data-sk=\"tooltip_parent\">Affinidi’s Candidate Privacy Policy</a>, and consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your personal data for recruitment purposes, as described in the&nbsp;<a class=\"c-link\" href=\"https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-stringify-link=\"https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf\" data-sk=\"tooltip_parent\">policy</a>.&nbsp;</p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
