    kgjobs:sourceOccurrence <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/occurrence/arbeitnow-stage-alternance-sales-development-representative-sdr-ai-innovation-ecosystem-9th-arrondissement-of-paris-75009-paris-116113/1> ;
